id: giant-weapon
name: Giant Weapon
kind: crafting
slots: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Attacks with it 3(T) higher on the Wound Roll, and 1(T) lower on the Strike Roll for each Size
  Category its wielder is under Enormous.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Increase your Wound Rolls with this Weapon by 3(T). Reduce your Strike Rolls with
  this Weapon by 1(T) for every Size Category you are smaller than Enormous.
text: >
  Giant Weapon: This Weapon is massively over-sized, making it unwieldy for most users.
  –Weapon Type: All
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 2
  –Effects: Increase your Wound Rolls with this Weapon by 3(T). Reduce your Strike Rolls with
  this Weapon by 1(T) for every Size Category you are smaller than Enormous.

---

# `$belowEnormous` is how many Size Categories its wielder is under Enormous right now - Medium
# is 2 - and nothing for Enormous and larger.
[passive]
weapon.wound += 3(T);
weapon.strike -= 1(T) * $belowEnormous;
